# Homebrew / Mac App Store inventory. Linked to ~/.config/homebrew/Brewfile,
# so `brew bundle --global` reads it from anywhere.
#
# Ownership:
#   - GUI apps: `cask` here, or `mas` for Mac App Store apps.
#   - CLI tools and language runtimes: mise (.config/mise/config.toml), not here.
#     scripts/verify_brewfile.sh fails when a `brew` entry duplicates a mise tool.
#   - `brew` formulae: only what mise cannot provide, or libraries that
#     mise-installed binaries link against at runtime.

